  <dialog class="company-modal" id="modal-amazon">
    <button class="modal-close" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
    <h3>Amazon</h3>
    <p class="modal-sub">2020–Present · Product &amp; New Product Innovation</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Designed, built, and operate a production LLM pipeline generating customer-facing content across 14 marketplaces (42 locales), cutting production time from ~24 hours to ~4 and costs ~90%.</li>
      <li>Authored PRDs and BRDs for AI products — requirements, workflows, edge cases, and evaluation criteria.</li>
      <li>Shaped $1B+ of 0-to-1 investment decisions across 5 product lines and 15+ new businesses; drove ambitious bets (indoor agriculture, EV charging, home energy hardware) to CEO-level review.</li>
      <li>As sole finance &amp; GTM partner on 2-person "Build It" teams, helped ship 3 consumer-electronics products from concept to launch; co-authored the PR/FAQ for Echo custom silicon (AZ3 / AZ3 Pro).</li>
    </ul>
  </dialog>

